WEBVTT

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:32.945
Enquanto eu crescia,

00:00:32.987 --> 00:00:35.656
tive consolo nos livros que eu lia,

00:00:35.698 --> 00:00:38.367
e os personagens que conheci nesses livros

00:00:38.409 --> 00:00:39.827
me ofereceram amizade.

00:00:41.537 --> 00:00:43.039
Personagens como Ralph S. Mouse

00:00:43.081 --> 00:00:45.625
de “The Mouse and the Motorcycle”,
de Beverly Cleary.

00:00:46.751 --> 00:00:48.461
Snoopy, Garfield.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:55.510
Eles me ofereceram companhia
conforme eu lidava com o trauma

00:00:55.551 --> 00:00:59.722
da luta de toda a vida
de minha mãe contra as drogas,